{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01867",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 3.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.41,
      "end_seconds": 8.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Okay, what would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.85,
      "end_seconds": 14.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "So, you know, I've been feeling low most days, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.6,
      "end_seconds": 19.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.17,
      "end_seconds": 22.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "About... well, four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.96,
      "end_seconds": 27.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.25,
      "end_seconds": 32.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "About a six out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.94,
      "end_seconds": 37.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "What about no energy, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.93,
      "end_seconds": 41.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.61,
      "end_seconds": 48.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.66,
      "end_seconds": 54.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.73,
      "end_seconds": 55.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.39,
      "end_seconds": 60.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.28,
      "end_seconds": 67.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.71,
      "end_seconds": 72.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.5,
      "end_seconds": 75.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.5,
      "end_seconds": 82.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.12,
      "end_seconds": 87.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.78,
      "end_seconds": 92.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.2,
      "end_seconds": 114.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.61,
      "end_seconds": 121.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Tiotropium inhaler. I take it once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.15,
      "end_seconds": 125.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.39,
      "end_seconds": 130.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.81,
      "end_seconds": 134.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.47,
      "end_seconds": 138.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I've had COPD for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.64,
      "end_seconds": 149.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Alright, and what about thoughts of harming myself, panic attacks, drinking more or hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.15,
      "end_seconds": 160.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "I haven't had thoughts of harming myself, panic attacks, drinking more or hearing voices, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.93,
      "end_seconds": 164.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.41,
      "end_seconds": 166.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.76,
      "end_seconds": 169.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.2,
      "end_seconds": 173.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.16,
      "end_seconds": 177.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.32,
      "end_seconds": 186.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.18,
      "end_seconds": 205.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.6, pulse 81, blood pressure 115 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.2,
      "end_seconds": 210.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.95,
      "end_seconds": 213.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.05,
      "end_seconds": 234.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "You are tearful and speaking slowly, but you are following everything well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.86,
      "end_seconds": 240.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.52,
      "end_seconds": 265.58,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. It fits best with a moderate depressive episode. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.36,
      "end_seconds": 293.81,
      "duration_seconds": 11.45,
      "text": "Let's get a blood count, for tiredness. What I'm giving you is sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day in the morning, long term. It's for low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.35,
      "end_seconds": 296.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.78,
      "end_seconds": 317.36,
      "duration_seconds": 15.58,
      "text": "Try a short walk each day and keep a regular sleep routine. If you have thoughts of harming yourself, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.32,
      "end_seconds": 325.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}